  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1" flags="0x0">
    <title>B1 - Bypass flow-model output filter gain</title>
    <description>Filters output of model F7A6 from E3D6 to E3E0 when enabled. Evidence: CPU E34C0..E34DC uses cal1104&lt;&lt;8 and BCf54. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 230kompressor_EVO_Joao.bin. Calibration block 1. cal9489 !=0. Second motorized air flap: actual E3A2, target E3C4, motor PW3; distinct from main throttle E5EA/PW2. Bypass/recirculation identification is strongly supported by the air-path calculation and two-actuator architecture, but no verified physical connector-to-RAM or manufacturer symbol has been recovered. Position values remain native sensor counts, not degrees or percent.</description>
