    <description>Lower ignition bound, corrected by coolant curve and limited by D00A before final per-channel clamp. Evidence: CPU C2248: BC04A(1EBA,E062),BC094(1EC3,E51B),BC138(3952)+E00D -&gt; E00E; consumed C1EC6. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 230kompressor_EVO_Joao.bin. Calibration block 3. Nominal physical scale inferred algebraically from SIM4LE PID 0E encoder E021C and inverted final angle F58C. Final angle also includes corrections, clamps and OBD quantization; this is not a direct delivered-angle command.</description>
