    <title>B3 - Ignition correction by coolant and intake temperature</title>
    <description>Signed correction: raw 128 is neutral; lower retards, higher advances. Subsequent RPM/load weighting differs by sign. Evidence: CPU BFED8..BFF24: BC04A(1F27,E06F),BC094(1F2E,E071),BC138(3B4D)-128 -&gt; E015. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 230kompressor_EVO_Joao.bin. Calibration block 3.</description>
