  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x12f" flags="0x0">
    <title>B3 - High-demand fuel enrichment target</title>
    <description>Target E076 for ramped additive enrichment E075; E075*64 joins the /16384 normalized fuel correction. Evidence: CPU E5210..E5234 selects target; C6E38..C6E44 adds E075&lt;&lt;6; C6EE4 applies normalized factor Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 230kompressor_EVO_Joao.bin. Calibration block 3. FD12.6 set and FD1C.4 clear; FD12.6 is high demand from throttle OR load, subject to RPM/coolant/speed gates (BF4xx) Target is additional fuel fraction, not lambda or AFR; high demand is not exclusively wide-open throttle.</description>
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x0" mmedaddress="0xf1ae" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedcolcount="12" mmedmajorstridebits="8" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
