  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x13f" flags="0x0">
    <title>B3 - Knock acquisition integrator code - channel 1</title>
    <description>Knock acquisition front-end setting, not spark advance. Lower five bits are sent with command prefix0xC0. The command protocol matches HIP9011/TPIC8101 integration-time setting. Evidence: CPU F207C..F218C selects channel E067=0; BC3A4(2F9C)|C0 -&gt; F56D+channel; ISR B671E..B6774 copies command to SPI queue F575. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 230kompressor_EVO_Joao.bin. Calibration block 3. Raw command index retained: hardware chip identity not proven. TPIC8101-compatible index19=220us,index20=240us, but do not apply linear degree or time scaling. Logical channel is not an asserted physical cylinder.</description>
