    <title>B4 - Idle-state ignition ceiling by intake temperature and load</title>
    <description>Upper bound on processed advance in FD12.2 idle state. This is not a universal WOT IAT retard map. Evidence: CPU C24BA..C24EE: BC04A(1EB0,E071),BC094(1EB5,E51B),BC138(393E); E108=min(E110,lookup&lt;&lt;8). Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 230kompressor_EVO_Joao.bin. Calibration block 4. Nominal physical scale inferred algebraically from SIM4LE PID 0E encoder E021C and inverted final angle F58C. Final angle also includes corrections, clamps and OBD quantization; this is not a direct delivered-angle command.</description>
