    <title>B4 - Overspeed intervention margin above active RPM limit</title>
    <description>Above active E36A plus this margin, sets the overspeed latch and forces the RPM-controller request E5D0 to zero. Latch clears at or below E36A. Evidence: CPU F3F78..F3FB4: limit+cal149A, compare E35A, set/clear FD90.2. F4048..F404C: E5D0=0 while latch set. Confidence: structure transferred from M10062; target program unavailable Source image: 230kompressor_EVO_Joao.bin. Calibration block 4. This is an RPM-controller intervention margin, not independently proven to be a direct injector or ignition hard-cut threshold.</description>
